{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29238","headline":"南海使院对菊怀丁卯别墅 · 许浑","name":"南海使院对菊怀丁卯别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处曾移菊，溪桥鹤岭东。\n篱疎还有艳，园小亦无丛。\n日晚秋烟里，星繁晓露中。\n影摇金涧水，香染玉潭风。\n罢酒慙陶令，题诗答谢公。\n朝来数花发，身在尉佗宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}